		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Pony-sized blue anteaters that drain magic. Often used by anti-magic crusaders and treasure hunters as mounts.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 10, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 trunk (disenchant), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Disenchant</strong>. Opposed DEX against a target's worn magic item. If successful, drained and becomes non-magical.</p><p></p><p><strong>Dispel Vulnerable</strong>. Dispel magic causes 4d6 damage to disenchanters.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
